         ┌───────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┐
         ▼                                                       ▼
Standardized Clinical Trials                              Real-World Biobanks
    (e.g., CAMP, CARE)                                     (e.g., BioVU, UKB)
         │                                                       │
 • Rigorous, active phenotyping.                         • Retrospective EMR/EHR registry.
